---
// src/pages/privacy-policy.astro
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_METADATA } from '@/lib/constants';

const pageTitle = `Privacy Policy - ${SITE_METADATA.title}`;
const pageDesc = 'Read Study Bhai\'s privacy policy detailing our data practices, cookie usage, Google AdSense disclosures, and commitment to student privacy.';
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDesc}>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <section class="legal-hero-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="legal-card">
        <p class="lead-text">
          At <strong>Study Bhai</strong> (accessible from <a href="https://studybhai.com">https://studybhai.com</a>), one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by Study Bhai and how we use it.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Study Bhai is primarily a free, public educational repository. You can browse, read, and download all textbooks, chapter notes, and past papers without creating an account or providing any personal information.
        </p>
        <p>
          We only collect personal information if you voluntarily submit it to us, such as when filling out our contact form or emailing our support team with your name, email address, and message contents.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Log Files & Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          Like most modern websites, Study Bhai follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites. The information collected by log files includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks. These are not linked to any information that is personally identifiable. The purpose of the information is for analyzing trends, administering the site, tracking users' movement on the website, and gathering demographic information to optimize server speeds.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
        <p>
          Study Bhai uses 'cookies' to store information including visitors' preferences and the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited. The information is used to optimize the users' experience by customizing our web page content based on visitors' browser type and/or other information.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Google DoubleClick DART Cookie & Google AdSense</h2>
        <p>
          Google is one of our third-party advertising vendors on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to www.studybhai.com and other sites on the internet. However, visitors may choose to decline the use of DART cookies by visiting the Google ad and content network Privacy Policy at the following URL: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Advertising Partners Privacy Policies</h2>
        <p>
          Third-party ad servers or ad networks use technologies like cookies, JavaScript, or Web Beacons that are used in their respective advertisements and links that appear on Study Bhai, which are sent directly to users' browser. They automatically receive your IP address when this occurs. These technologies are used to measure the effectiveness of their advertising campaigns and/or to personalize the advertising content that you see on websites that you visit.
        </p>
        <p>
          Note that Study Bhai has no access to or control over these cookies that are used by third-party advertisers.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Third Party Privacy Policies</h2>
        <p>
          Study Bhai's Privacy Policy does not apply to other advertisers or websites. Thus, we are advising you to consult the respective Privacy Policies of these third-party ad servers for more detailed information. It may include their practices and instructions about how to opt-out of certain options.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Children's Information (COPPA Compliance)</h2>
        <p>
          Another part of our priority is adding protection for children while using the internet. We encourage parents and guardians to observe, participate in, and/or monitor and guide their online activity. Study Bhai does not knowingly collect any Personal Identifiable Information from children under the age of 13. If you think that your child provided this kind of information on our website, we strongly encourage you to contact us immediately and we will do our best efforts to promptly remove such information from our records.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us through email at <a href="mailto:support@studybhai.com">support@studybhai.com</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-hero-section {
    padding: 70px 0 50px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f0f3fa 0%, #ffffff 100%);
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-wine-dark);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-content-section {
    padding: 60px 0 80px;
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .legal-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 40px 50px;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .lead-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-card h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-wine-dark);
    margin: 32px 0 12px;
  }

  .legal-card p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .legal-card a {
    color: var(--color-wine);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-card {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
